      <agendaitemtitle>Legislative Consent Motion: The Cyber Security and Resilience (Network Information Systems) Bill</agendaitemtitle>
      <agendatext>

&lt;div class=WordSection1&gt;

&lt;p class=MsoNormal style='vertical-align:baseline'&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style='font-family:
"Lucida Sans Unicode",sans-serif'&gt;NDM9331&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style='font-family:
"Lucida Sans Unicode",sans-serif'&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style='font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'&gt;&lt;a
href="https://senedd.wales/people/adam-price-ms/"&gt;&lt;span style='font-family:
"Lucida Sans Unicode",sans-serif'&gt;Adam Price (Sir Gaerfyrddin)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style='font-family:"Lucida Sans Unicode",sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-font-kerning:1.0pt;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;
mso-fareast-language:EN-US'&gt;To propose that the Senedd, in accordance with
Standing Order 29.6, agrees that provisions in the Cyber Security and
Resilience (Network and Information Systems) Bill, in so far as they have
regard to devolved matters, should be considered by the UK Parliament.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style='font-family:"Lucida Sans Unicode",sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-font-kerning:1.0pt;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;
mso-fareast-language:EN-US'&gt;A Legislative Consent Memorandum was &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span
style='font-family:"Aptos",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-font-kerning:
1.0pt;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:EN-US'&gt;&lt;a
href="https://laiddocuments.senedd.wales/lcm-ld18057-en.pdf"&gt;&lt;span
style='font-family:"Lucida Sans Unicode",sans-serif'&gt;laid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span
style='font-family:"Lucida Sans Unicode",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
Aptos;mso-font-kerning:1.0pt;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;mso-fareast-language:
EN-US'&gt; in Table Office on 9 June 2026 in accordance with Standing Order 29.2.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style='font-family:"Lucida Sans Unicode",sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-font-kerning:1.0pt;mso-ligatures:standardcontextual;
mso-fareast-language:EN-US'&gt;A copy of the Bill can be found on the UK
Parliament website:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

